/3/episode/5"},{"id":"1598446","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"While Hamazura is out running errands for Mugino, SCHOOL stages an attack on ITEM. When Mugino runs from Kakine, Takitsubo offers to protect Hamazura, but ends up needing his help instead. Kakine issues a challenge to Accelerator.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2018-11-09","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iHHfhqceV2AsbHvpKcVSBkeb5Ut.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iHHfhqceV2AsbHvpKcVSBkeb5Ut.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/30980/season/3/episode/6"},{"id":"1604571","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"A threat from Acqua against Kamijo leads Itsuwa to come to Academy City as his live-in bodyguard. Index, Kamijo and Itsuwa visit a spa in the third level of the complex beneath the 22nd School District. Mikoto frets over Kamijo's amnesia.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2018-11-16","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/whTfUVmlbbLUwN0UGnBj4Sjl4FR.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/whTfUVmlbbLUwN0UGnBj4Sjl4FR.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/30980/season/3/episode/7"},{"id":"1604572","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"With Kamijo unconscious, Itsuwa is guilt-ridden, and receives a pep talk from Tatemiya. As Orsola researches Acqua's past, the Amakusa Church members make their stand against Acqua, at which Itsuwa reveals their new secret weapon.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2018-11-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eOY2WgUuWkwqt