cking down the members of New Light.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2018-12-14","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/56J6lU5C9rk0WUUJmdJpI074mm.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/56J6lU5C9rk0WUUJmdJpI074mm.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/30980/season/3/episode/11"},{"id":"1604577","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":12,"title":{"value":"Episodio 12","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"As the coup continues, even the sisters of the puritan church are targeted, while the queen and princesses find their lives in danger. Index analyzes the evidence of the Eurotunnel blast. Knight Leader is confronted by a former colleague.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2018-12-21","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/r9BBWdCCpBI28lqULT2xLTrc5a9.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/r9BBWdCCpBI28lqULT2xLTrc5a9.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/30980/season/3/episode/12"},{"id":"1653843","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":13,"title":{"value":"Episodio 13","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Acqua and Knight Leader continue their fateful showdown in the forest. Princess Carissa reveals a devastating new technique using Curtana Original. When Kamijo and Index's lives are endangered, an unexpected ally comes to their rescue.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2018-12-28","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/plIuM4wNI0p2hM73Dwb0tzAucZg.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/plIuM4wNI0p2hM73Dwb0tzAucZg.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/30980/season/3/episode/13"},{"id":"1666547","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":14,"title":{"value":"Episodio 14","language":"it-IT"},"overvie